{"id":"u-efb5d272-0ad2-4766-b1dc-ec02b370631c","src":"community","title":"Actually good PPL","author":"Teleoflexuous","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/NW6d2N-actually-good-ppl","desc":"Following\n1) modern hypertrophy knowledge (no hammer curls here or conventional deadlifts)\n2) my personal interest (no neck extensions to be seen, 6 day/week) 3) my particular gym setup (zones of dumbbells, free weights, machines and cable zones, but no hack squat machine)\nI made this PPL program, because adjusting existing PPL was simply more work.\n\nNotes:\nMost of the time, first set is a warmup. Secon dset is meant to be 'a bit heavier' than the rest of sets. In case of multiple sets with the same weight, sets from 2 onward are myo reps.\nThere are calves in some pull days and arms in some legs day. There was enough time to recover from the last training, so why not.\nSupersets are meant to shorten training time. Exercises don't overlap + that's my gym setup. Maintain former, adjust latter yourself.\nFeel free to run this 2-3 times in a row, updating 1RM on each run.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:40:00.098Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Pull","Push","Legs","Pull","Push","Legs"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deficit Pendlay Row","sets":[{"r":16,"pct":35},{"r":12,"pct":50},{"r":14,"pct":45,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":16,"pct":35},{"r":12,"pct":50},{"r":14,"pct":45,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":16,"pct":35},{"r":12,"pct":50},{"r":14,"pct":45,"x":2}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":16,"pct":35},{"r":12,"pct":50},{"r":14,"pct":45,"x":3}]},{"n":"Crossbody Lat Pull","sets":[{"r":16,"pct":35},{"r":12,"pct":50},{"r":14,"pct":45,"x":2}]}]},{"n":"Jefferson Curls","sets":[{"r":16,"pct":35},{"r":12,"pct":50},{"r":14,"pct":45,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Wrist Curls","sets":[{"r":16,"pct":35},{"r":12,"pct":50},{"r":1